
metadata:
  book_id: "sunan-shafii"
  book_name: "Sunan al-Shafi'i"
  total_hadiths: "648"
  available_languages: "ar,bn,bs,de,en,es,fr,hi,id,roman-ur,ru,sw,ta,te,tr,ur"
  ai_translated_languages: "bn,bs,de,es,fr,hi,id,roman-ur,ru,sw,ta,te,tr"
  ai_translation_note: "The following languages are machine-assisted translations from the Arabic via LLM, disclosed per-row with an [AI-translation] prefix: bn,bs,de,es,fr,hi,id,roman-ur,ru,sw,ta,te,tr. All other languages are human/scholarly translations."
  intro: "The Sunan attributed to Imam al-Shafi'i (d. 204 AH) gathers hadith arranged by chapters of jurisprudence. Presented here in 648 hadith with Arabic, English and Urdu."
  intro_ar: "السنن المنسوبة إلى الإمام الشافعي (ت 204هـ) تجمع الأحاديث مرتبة على أبواب الفقه. تُعرض هنا في 648 حديثا بالعربية والإنجليزية والأردية."
  intro_en: "The Sunan attributed to Imam al-Shafi'i (d. 204 AH) gathers hadith arranged by chapters of jurisprudence. Presented here in 648 hadith with Arabic, English and Urdu."
  intro_ur: "سنن الشافعی (م 204ھ) فقہی ابواب پر مرتب احادیث کا مجموعہ ہے۔ یہاں 648 احادیث عربی، انگریزی اور اردو کے ساتھ پیش ہیں۔"
  intro_bn: "The Sunan attributed to Imam al-Shafi'i (d. 204 AH) gathers hadith arranged by chapters of jurisprudence. Presented here in 648 hadith with Arabic, English and Urdu."
